    <string-array name="guide_body">
        <item>Left is "DualPane Left", right is "DualPane Right".\nCast to either side and the video lands there.</item>
        <item>Focus is on the left. Left/Right seek.\nUp/Down change only this side\'s volume.</item>
        <item>MENU lands on the divider.\nLeft/Right resize it, press again to cross over.</item>
        <item>Focus is on the right. Press OK to play or pause.\nLong-press OK for the menu: local videos, decoder, picture-in-picture.</item>
        <item>After opening it looks like this: left fills the screen, right becomes a small window.\nMENU switches focus, BACK returns to the big pane first.</item>
    </string-array>
